the classes the shell toggles, defined in one place so a stylesheet
and a renderer cannot disagree about their names:
  highlight -> studio-teach-highlight
  pulse     -> studio-teach-pulse
  focus     -> "" (no class; focus is grab_focus)

.studio-teach-highlight {
  outline: 2px solid #d08770;
  outline-offset: -2px;
}
.studio-teach-pulse {
  outline: 3px solid #d08770;
  outline-offset: -3px;
  background-color: alpha(#d08770, 0.15);
}

annotation tint: #ffe9b0
pulse duration: 1200ms
